+
+Separate prospective block after frozen iterated-limit proof8363d46a. Before deriving estimates, keep the same fixed22face cube, adapted literal-source coordinates and kappa>=1. Target an explicit finite power M for one-step actual normalized central operator error <=C kappa^M/beta, with model-dependent finite C, and then an explicit polynomial beta_n=n^P for kappa_n=4n²/(5t²) giving actual n-step convergence in the common oscillator space. Do not optimize exponents or assert numerical accuracy/onset.
